WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.434 --> 00:00:02.181
(guitar strumming)

00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:29.984
- What?

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.391
♫ Hey ♫

00:00:50.206 --> 00:00:51.919
(elves screaming)

00:00:51.925 --> 00:00:53.555
- Santa, what are you doing?

00:01:00.898 --> 00:01:02.778
- Chris, I've been gay for
a while, you know this.

00:01:02.778 --> 00:01:04.247
It wasn't just last year.

00:01:04.578 --> 00:01:06.987
- Alright well, I'll go
give this to someone else.

00:01:07.422 --> 00:01:08.995
- Yeah, I'd suggest that.

00:01:09.721 --> 00:01:10.969
- [Chris] I hate Christmas!

00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:12.969
- Ho ho ho!

00:01:18.918 --> 00:01:21.048
(shouting indistinctly)

00:01:32.326 --> 00:01:34.009
- Like a mother (beep) goat honey,

00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:34.926
you look crazy!

00:01:34.926 --> 00:01:35.971
Can you even fly with those thighs?

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:38.043
Look at that nose, can't even
light up a god (beep) fridge!

00:01:38.328 --> 00:01:39.576
I'm Olive, bitch!

00:01:39.628 --> 00:01:42.812
- Oooh, sleigh.

00:01:43.164 --> 00:01:44.464
(sleigh bells ringing)

00:01:44.464 --> 00:01:45.956
Sleigh, think about it.

00:02:12.479 --> 00:02:14.079
(laughing)

00:02:14.079 --> 00:02:14.955
(wretching)

00:02:22.255 --> 00:02:23.357
- [Girl] Whoa!

00:02:24.414 --> 00:02:27.102
(objects clattering)

00:02:27.181 --> 00:02:28.505
(groaning)

00:02:28.505 --> 00:02:31.762
♫ My wish come true

00:02:45.895 --> 00:02:47.216
♫ Baby

00:02:47.216 --> 00:02:50.454
♫ All I want for Christmas is

00:02:50.454 --> 00:02:53.014
♫ Food baby

00:02:54.355 --> 00:02:55.760
- Merry Christmas!

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.060
- Happy Hanukkah!

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:58.337
- Happy New Year!

00:02:58.337 --> 00:03:00.041
- And chicken and rice!

00:03:00.041 --> 00:03:03.211
♫ Chicken and rice, chicken and rice

00:03:03.211 --> 00:03:06.217
♫ Chicken and rice, chicken and rice ♫

00:03:06.217 --> 00:03:09.620
(singing indistinctly)

